<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Cisco SecureX is a unified security platform that connects Cisco's security portfolio and third-party tools to provide integrated visibility, automation, and response across your entire security infrastructure.</p>
<p>Powered by Talos, one of the world's largest commercial threat intelligence teams, SecureX leverages AI and machine learning to identify threats, automate responses, and reduce mean time to detection and remediation.</p>
<p>The platform serves as a central hub for security operations, enabling teams to investigate threats, orchestrate responses, and manage security posture across endpoints, networks, cloud, and applications.</p>
